invariant: INV-16
file: src/chacha20.c
catches: test/chacha-builds.sh
reason: use_sve2 answers no for every session, so a caller that set
  CH_CPU_SVE2 runs the NEON path and chacha20_sve2.c's copy never runs.
  test/chacha-builds.sh requires chacha20_xor_cpu for arm64 to call
  chacha20_sve2_xor, and the compiler drops a call that no value reaches.

--- old
    return (cpu & CH_CPU_SVE2) != 0;
--- new
    return (cpu & CH_CPU_SVE2) != 0 && cpu == 0;
